       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PROCESS-CONTRACT-QUAL-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-OPERATIONAL-BOUNDS.
           05  WS-RULE2-NO-GIT-BINARIES    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE4-NO-BROWSER-PUPPET  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE6-PID-TRACKING-SAFE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE9-ADDR-ZMM-RESOLVE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE14-DISPLACE-WMQ-SYNC PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-OPERATIONAL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-PROCESS-CONTRACT-QUAL-MET PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-OPERATIONAL-CODE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-AUDIT-PROCESS-SAFEGUARDS.
           PERFORM 2000-AUDIT-ZMM-CONTRACT-ROUTING.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-OPERATIONAL-QUAL.
           GOBACK.
       1000-AUDIT-PROCESS-SAFEGUARDS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE2-NO-GIT-BINARIES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE4-NO-BROWSER-PUPPET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE6-PID-TRACKING-SAFE.
       2000-AUDIT-ZMM-CONTRACT-ROUTING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE9-ADDR-ZMM-RESOLVE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE14-DISPLACE-WMQ-SYNC.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-OPERATIONAL-QUAL.
           IF WS-RULE2-NO-GIT-BINARIES = 1 AND
              WS-RULE4-NO-BROWSER-PUPPET = 1 AND
              WS-RULE6-PID-TRACKING-SAFE = 1 AND
              WS-RULE9-ADDR-ZMM-RESOLVE = 1 AND
              WS-RULE14-DISPLACE-WMQ-SYNC = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PROCESS-CONTRACT-QUAL-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-OPERATIONAL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-PROCESS-CONTRACT-QUAL-MET
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-OPERATIONAL-CODE.
